# Guardian Project and Bot1's first Grizzly Bears: the creature itself is no "another" creature (CR 201.2), so its
# name is unshared and Bot1 draws exactly one card (CR 603.6a, 603.4). Bot2's own Grizzly Bears on the battlefield is no
# creature Bot1 controls, so it does not stop the draw: "another creature you control" reads Bot1's creatures alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
